  <note xmi:id="_6Ln-r8mCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ" opaque="true" posX="32" posY="32" sizeHeight="193" sizeWidth="673" text="Before running this sample ensure you have messanger server running&#xD;&#xA;ActiveMQ is a good choice to provide the MQ brokers.&#xD;&#xA;This sample works on default amqp and mqtt host (localhost) and ports (61613, 1883)&#xD;&#xA;Other configuration specified in MQConnectionFactory.&#xD;&#xA;Works with Route MQMultiSender, run the Receiver first, then run the Sender.&#xD;&#xA;If popup window asks you to install required libraries (camel-mqtt-alldep) or others - do this before&#xD;&#xA;running the route.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;You can deactive spcific MQ nodes."/>
